# yarn format checks every file Prettier supports, except .gitignore entries and this list.

# Generated from the Figma export. Never hand-edited (AGENTS.md section 4, rule 8).
/tokens/
src/theme/styles/tokens-*.css

# Written by tools that do not run Prettier: changesets (pre-release state) and
# ESLint (yarn lint:code --prune-suppressions, without a final newline).
.changeset/pre.json
eslint-suppressions.json

# Prose (docs, changesets, CHANGELOG.md). Prettier would also reformat the aligned
# comments inside the code blocks of AGENTS.md.
*.md

# Prettier's MDX parser only understands MDX v1; Storybook uses MDX v3.
*.mdx
